{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藍田啟田邨發生火警。今日（17日）下午約1時43分，啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，驚動多人報案。現場影片可見，起火單位位處高層，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。消防趕往現場灌救，據悉下午2時03分大致將火救熄。</p><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199364215467544576592614.jpeg/qCvmThWO5s5SeQ534zlZfQ51oDWP5mJqS0vuS0tL7ks\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Derek Wong / 藍田關注組）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199366725682860032014689.jpeg/VajsBaJbtMXGxHOcW0_8YYE-0-JpjrIYLCZMgywmTIM\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Derek Wong / 藍田關注組）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199364213152157696825934.jpeg/huxS9_St792NL5TIHIv8fYKogCYdVWREXGQ4Z1xkOGc\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田邨啟旺樓一單位起火，火舌噴出窗外，烈焰沖天，黑煙席捲半空。（Threads / holankick 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.939729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:14:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:56.554459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:56.554459+00:00","content_hash":"9f98ae8d4b66639e70e66b08e9909c2c7973792b2235d2b0edfde13b2446abb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}